 127+ 671E 3C               INC A
 128+ 671F 32 51 82         LD (CurrentObjective), A
 129+ 6722 CD 0F F1         CALL ResolveObjectiveScreen
 130+ 6725 3E FF            LD A, $FF
 131+ 6727 32 54 82         LD (PreviousObjectiveDistance), A
 132+ 672A C9               RET
