  54+ 6B26 23               INC HL
  55+ 6B27 3A 90 82         LD A, (CurrentScreenY)
  56+ 6B2A 77               LD (HL), A
  57+ 6B2B 23               INC HL
  58+ 6B2C 3A 39 81         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSX)
  59+ 6B2F 77               LD (HL), A
  60+ 6B30 23               INC HL
  61+ 6B31 3A 3A 81         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSY)
