 116+ 9CE8 5D               LD E, L
 117+ 9CE9 3E 00            LD A, 0
 118+ 9CEB 01 FD FF         LD BC, $FFFD
 119+ 9CEE ED 79            OUT (C), A
 120+ 9CF0 01 FD BF         LD BC, $BFFD
 121+ 9CF3 ED 59            OUT (C), E
 122+ 9CF5                  ; R1 = period high (canal A)
 123+ 9CF5 5C               LD E, H
 124+ 9CF6 3E 01            LD A, 1
 125+ 9CF8 01 FD FF         LD BC, $FFFD
 126+ 9CFB ED 79            OUT (C), A
