1569+ AB9E 06 03            LD B, MONSTERS_TO_SPAWN
1570+ ABA0              .cpmoLoop:
1571+ ABA0 C5               PUSH BC
1572+ ABA1                  ; Solo monsters activos, no muriendo/spawneando/asustados (scared = atravesables)
1573+ ABA1 DD 7E 01         LD A, (IX+ENT_TYPE)
1574+ ABA4 FE 02            CP TYPE_MONSTER
1575+ ABA6 20 57            JR NZ, .cpmoNext
1576+ ABA8 DD 7E 02         LD A, (IX+ENT_STATE)
1577+ ABAB FE 03            CP STATE_DYING
1578+ ABAD 28 50            JR Z, .cpmoNext
