1793+ ACDF              .animFight:
1794+ ACDF                  ; Pelear usa lastHDir (bits 4-7 de ENT_DIR)
1795+ ACDF DD 7E 0A         LD A, (IX+ENT_DIR)
1796+ ACE2 0F               RRCA
1797+ ACE3 0F               RRCA
1798+ ACE4 0F               RRCA
1799+ ACE5 0F               RRCA
1800+ ACE6 E6 0F            AND $0F                     ; lastHDir
1801+ ACE8 FE 08            CP DIR_W
1802+ ACEA 28 04            JR Z, .fightW
1803+ ACEC 16 16            LD D, SPRID_ATTACK_EAST
1804+ ACEE 18 02            JR .fightSet
