1914+ AD96 32 D7 B6         LD (AttackSfxPlayed), A         ; Marcar: ya sono este ciclo
1915+ AD99 C5               PUSH BC
1916+ AD9A D5               PUSH DE
1917+ AD9B 21 A9 F8         LD HL, SFX_Attack
1918+ AD9E CD 33 F8         CALL PlaySFX
