1932+ ADB1                  ; Timer expirado → avanzar frame
1933+ ADB1 DD 71 09         LD (IX+ENT_ANIMTIMER), C    ; Reset timer
1934+ ADB4
1935+ ADB4                  ; Paso: si el player esta corriendo, reproducir "tic-tac" alternado
1936+ ADB4 DD 7E 02         LD A, (IX+ENT_STATE)
1937+ ADB7 FE 01            CP STATE_RUNNING
