2003+ ADFF              ; UpdateStamina - Consume stamina al atacar, regenera al no atacar
2004+ ADFF              ; ==============================================================================
2005+ ADFF              UpdateStamina:
2006+ ADFF                  ; --- Regenerar salud (siempre, lento) ---
2007+ ADFF 3A D9 B6         LD A, (PlayerHealth)
2008+ AE02 FE 10            CP HEALTH_MAX
2009+ AE04 28 12            JR Z, .usHealthFull
2010+ AE06 21 DD B6         LD HL, HealthRegenCtr
2011+ AE09 34               INC (HL)
2012+ AE0A 7E               LD A, (HL)
2013+ AE0B FE 32            CP HEALTH_REGEN_RATE
2014+ AE0D 38 09            JR C, .usHealthFull
2015+ AE0F 36 00            LD (HL), 0
2016+ AE11 3A D9 B6         LD A, (PlayerHealth)
2017+ AE14 3C               INC A
2018+ AE15 32 D9 B6         LD (PlayerHealth), A
2019+ AE18              .usHealthFull:
