2042+ AE3B C8               RET Z                               ; Ya vacia
2043+ AE3C 21 DB B6         LD HL, StaminaDrainCtr
2044+ AE3F 34               INC (HL)
2045+ AE40 7E               LD A, (HL)
2046+ AE41 FE 0D            CP STAMINA_DRAIN_RATE
2047+ AE43 D8               RET C
2048+ AE44 36 00            LD (HL), 0
2049+ AE46 3A DA B6         LD A, (PlayerStamina)
2050+ AE49 3D               DEC A
2051+ AE4A 32 DA B6         LD (PlayerStamina), A
