2486+ B086 CB 57            BIT 2, A
2487+ B088 28 07            JR Z, .paRndRight
2488+ B08A 3A 9C 90         LD A, (CurrentEnemySpeed)
2489+ B08D ED 44            NEG
2490+ B08F 18 03            JR .paRndSetDX
2491+ B091              .paRndRight:
