4194+ BA37 DD 36 06 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAX), 0
4195+ BA3B DD 36 07 00      LD (IX+ENT_DELTAY), 0
4196+ BA3F              .spNotMonster:
4197+ BA3F C9               RET
4198+ BA40              .spFrameOk:
