4222+ BA56 7A               LD A, D
4223+ BA57 80               ADD A, B
4224+ BA58 3D               DEC A                           ; posX + W - 1
4225+ BA59 0F               RRCA
4226+ BA5A 0F               RRCA
4227+ BA5B 0F               RRCA
4228+ BA5C E6 1F            AND $1F
