4717+ BD0B 28 07            JR Z, .dxPos
4718+ BD0D 3A 9C 90         LD A, (CurrentEnemySpeed)
4719+ BD10 ED 44            NEG
4720+ BD12 18 03            JR .setDX
4721+ BD14              .dxPos:
4722+ BD14 3A 9C 90         LD A, (CurrentEnemySpeed)
4723+ BD17              .setDX:
