6948+ CA07 ED 52            SBC HL, DE
6949+ CA09 E1               POP HL
6950+ CA0A 30 0D            JR NC, .udtTrySpawn                 ; HL >= threshold (caso reintento)
6951+ CA0C 23               INC HL
6952+ CA0D 22 7F 82         LD (DeathScreenTimer), HL
6953+ CA10 E5               PUSH HL
6954+ CA11 11 F4 01         LD DE, DEATH_SPAWN_FRAMES
6955+ CA14 B7               OR A
6956+ CA15 ED 52            SBC HL, DE
