7192+ CB61 3D               DEC A
7193+ CB62 47               LD B, A
7194+ CB63 3A 75 5F         LD A, (DBfsCurCy)
7195+ CB66 4F               LD C, A
7196+ CB67 3E 02            LD A, MAI_DIR_W
7197+ CB69 CD EB CB         CALL .bfsTryNbr
7198+ CB6C              .bfsTryE:
7199+ CB6C 3A 74 5F         LD A, (DBfsCurCx)
7200+ CB6F FE 1F            CP 31
7201+ CB71 D2 09 CB         JP NC, .bfsLoop
7202+ CB74 3C               INC A
7203+ CB75 47               LD B, A
7204+ CB76 3A 75 5F         LD A, (DBfsCurCy)
7205+ CB79 4F               LD C, A
