7276+ CC02 CD 67 CC         CALL .bfsIsVisited
7277+ CC05 C0               RET NZ
7278+ CC06                  ; Footprint 3x3 libre?
7279+ CC06 CD 96 CC         CALL .bfsCanFit
7280+ CC09 C0               RET NZ
7281+ CC0A                  ; --- first_dir del nuevo entry: hereda si curFirstDir != NONE, si no usa step ---
7282+ CC0A 3A 76 5F         LD A, (DBfsCurFirstDir)
7283+ CC0D FE FF            CP MAI_DIR_NONE
7284+ CC0F 20 03            JR NZ, .nbrInherit
7285+ CC11 3A 7A 5F         LD A, (DBfsTryDir)
7286+ CC14              .nbrInherit:
