7288+ CC15                  ; Encolar
7289+ CC15 2A 6D 5F         LD HL, (DBfsQTail)
7290+ CC18 3A 78 5F         LD A, (DBfsTryCx)
7291+ CC1B 77               LD (HL), A
7292+ CC1C 23               INC HL
7293+ CC1D 3A 79 5F         LD A, (DBfsTryCy)
