1101+ D5EA                  ; Si solapa con algun pickup activo, set PickupAttrsDirty=1 para que
1102+ D5EA                  ; RefreshPickupAttrs (post-ProcessEnemies) repinte. Sin overlap = no-op.
1103+ D5EA 3A 9B 82         LD A, (NumPickupsCached)
