1177+ D642 DD 23            INC IX                      ; IX -> pixel data
1178+ D644
1179+ D644 CB 7B            BIT 7, E
1180+ D646 20 0A            JR NZ, .spSkipRle
1181+ D648
1182+ D648                  ; --- Path literal: saltar height * width bytes ---
1183+ D648 7B               LD A, E                     ; width_bytes (sin flag, bit7=0)
1184+ D649              .spLitRow:
1185+ D649 47               LD B, A
1186+ D64A              .spLitCol:
1187+ D64A DD 23            INC IX
