1829+ D940 73 DB            DEFW BgGfx_town_gate_key        ; 6: TownGate Key (id 186)
1830+ D942 AB D4            DEFW BgGfx_forestlock           ; 7: Forest Lock
1831+ D944 1C D5            DEFW BgGfx_ruinslock            ; 8: Ruins Lock
1832+ D946 FE D5            DEFW BgGfx_cemeterylock         ; 9: Cemetery Lock
