1835+ D948                  ; chocar contra él. Definidos en BumpTriggerTable + WallAlwaysTable.
1836+ D948 00 00            DEFW 0                          ; 10: ex-TownHall Door (ahora bump-trigger)
1837+ D94A 00 00            DEFW 0                          ; 11: ex-Church Door (ahora bump-trigger)
