  32+ EAFB              ; --- Tabla de transiciones automáticas (hora, fase) ---
  33+ EAFB              PhaseTable:
  34+ EAFB 07 00            DEFB 7,  0      ; 07:00 → DY     (10h pleno dia)
  35+ EAFD 11 01            DEFB 17, 1      ; 17:00 → C1     (crepusculo 1)
  36+ EAFF 12 02            DEFB 18, 2      ; 18:00 → C2     (crepusculo 2)
  37+ EB01 13 03            DEFB 19, 3      ; 19:00 → N1     (noche pre-medianoche)
  38+ EB03 00 04            DEFB 0,  4      ; 00:00 → N2     (noche con monstruos, post-campanadas)
  39+ EB05 05 05            DEFB 5,  5      ; 05:00 → A1     (amanecer 1)
  40+ EB07 06 06            DEFB 6,  6      ; 06:00 → A2     (amanecer 2)
