 293+ ED7F                  ; Atributos de la esfera (filas 0-1, cols 15-16)
 294+ ED7F 3E 47            LD A, $47              ; col 15: bright white
 295+ ED81 32 0F 58         LD ($580F), A
 296+ ED84 32 2F 58         LD ($582F), A
 297+ ED87 3E 07            LD A, $07              ; col 16: white
 298+ ED89 32 10 58         LD ($5810), A
