 352+ EDC8                  ; --- Atributos del sprite (2 filas × 6 cols) ---
 353+ EDC8                  ; Layout: [dec0][dec1][sfera_L][sfera_R][dec2][dec3]
 354+ EDC8                  ; Decoracion (cols 0,1,4,5): remap paper via ApplyDayCycleRemap
 355+ EDC8                  ; Esfera (cols 2,3): sin remap (gestionada por DrawClockFaceOnly)
 356+ EDC8 DD 23            INC IX                  ; saltar attr_h
 357+ EDCA DD 23            INC IX                  ; saltar attr_w
 358+ EDCC AF               XOR A
