  85+ F080 CD 0F F1         CALL ResolveObjectiveScreen
  86+ F083 3E FF            LD A, $FF
  87+ F085 32 54 82         LD (PreviousObjectiveDistance), A   ; brujula: primer cruce -> blanco
  88+ F088              .cmpDone:
