 195+ F90F              ; --- SFX_CountdownTick: bip ~700ms para "3" y "2" del countdown ---
 196+ F90F              ; Pitch 102 = ~1047 Hz. Calibrado para octava precisa con pitch 50 (ratio 1.992).
 197+ F90F              ; (PlaySFX tiene ~78T de overhead por ciclo ademas de 32*pitch -> ratio puro
 198+ F90F              ; 100/50 quedaria desafinado ~30 cents. Compensado a 102 da ~7 cents.)
 199+ F90F              SFX_CountdownTick:
 200+ F90F FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~239ms
 201+ F913 FA 66 00 00      DEFB 250, 102, 0, 0         ; ~478ms
 202+ F917 E6 66 00 00      DEFB 230, 102, 0, 0         ; ~219ms (total ~718ms)
 203+ F91B 00               DEFB 0
 204+ F91C
 205+ F91C              ; --- SFX_CountdownGo: octava arriba del Tick, ~1s ---
 206+ F91C              ; Pitch 50 = ~2086 Hz. Ratio period(102)/period(50) = 3342/1678 = 1.992.
 207+ F91C              SFX_CountdownGo:
 208+ F91C FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0          ; ~120ms cada step
 209+ F920 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 210+ F924 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 211+ F928 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 212+ F92C FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 213+ F930 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 214+ F934 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 215+ F938 FA 32 00 00      DEFB 250, 50, 0, 0
 216+ F93C 5A 32 00 00      DEFB 90, 50, 0, 0           ; total ~1003ms
 217+ F940 00               DEFB 0
